{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-09_beg","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-09","title":"立场不同","storyCode":"11-11","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"49b7c7ca6b96c03892563133e6ecee4a5af18346a8fdd5a260adfdacfd1fe327","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"为获取关于萨卡兹补给线的情报，罗德岛与自救军联军对城防军指挥塔发起进攻。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"9:37 A.M. 天气/阴\n伦蒂尼姆奥克特里格区，城防军总指挥塔附近"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛阿米娅特别行动队的干员们，按照计划，我们即将配合自救军，对伦蒂尼姆城防军指挥塔展开突袭行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的目标只有一个，取得城防系统中关于萨卡兹补给线的信息记录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这份信息将影响我们整个伦蒂尼姆行动的成败。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管......我们很可能已经来不及阻止特雷西斯向大公爵们宣战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果能得到这份情报，我们将有机会延缓战争的步伐，尽量减少战争带来的牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们尽可能做了许多准备，可仍有许多突发情况是无法预料的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们心中都很清楚，接下来的战斗，只会一场比一场艰难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们走到这里，都是为了同一个目标，一个不会动摇的目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该继续前进了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，还有一种突发情况。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"还有一位萨卡兹的王可能出现在战场上。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我知道你在担心我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能说自己一定准备好了......可自从离开萨迪恩区，我设想过许多遍下一回再见到她的情形。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她站在我们的对面，我很想知道她这样做的原因。我想感受......她所感受到的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就像我对干员们说的那样，我绝不会忘记我们来到这里的初衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚，特蕾西娅小姐所希望的萨卡兹和整片大地的未来正在离我们远去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那样的未来，正是我和凯尔希医生，还有每一个跟着我们一同进入伦蒂尼姆的干员渴望抓住的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为此，我们做好了迎接一切可能性的准备，也会像最后一战一样拼尽全力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那出发吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，博士，我们出发。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g7_controltower"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹的军队最近调动得很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，中校。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近大家都说......都说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们说萨卡兹马上就要和公爵部队开战了。到时候，他们会把我们做成血肉傀儡，扔到战场上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，中校。说这些违背了您制定的纪律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不怪你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们相信您，中校。我们都知道与萨卡兹交涉有多艰难......但您做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年里，是您带着我们走过了那么多险境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯塔福德公爵叛乱那次也是，要不是您的准确判断，我早就死在了叛军的炮火下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您一次次救了我们，也一次次在不同野心家的手里保住了这座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是您做的决定，我们都不会质疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是因为我知道......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下面街道上什么声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是货运线路......大概是给萨卡兹运材料的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警戒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——早上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，这些人是从哪里冒出来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别问了，除非你愿意花很多钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"雇佣兵......你们是谁派来的？哪位大公爵？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不认识任何大公爵。他们更不可能认识我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......你们是反抗军？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是伦蒂尼姆市民自救军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"自救军......自救......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很清楚这是为什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本该与萨卡兹战斗的人是你们。你们选择了投降，那我们只能自己站出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"防御！不能让他们进入指挥塔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是维多利亚人，没错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两万城防军官兵，遍布整座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了已经战死的和被俘的那些，全都被同一个命令死死绑在原地，变成了萨卡兹的帮凶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不可能不知道，萨卡兹就快和整个维多利亚开战了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那个时候，你们还准备站在萨卡兹那边，和他们一块对付你们的父母兄弟吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许你们只是想活下去。可是你们不是萨卡兹，永远得不到萨卡兹真正的信任。一旦正式开战，萨卡兹随时都可能将你们抛弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了你的犹豫。说到底，你们只是士兵。我们要对付的不是你们，而是那个下命令的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，让开吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"不许后退。一个都不要后退！守住这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是士兵。我们相信指挥官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须遵守命令。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g7_controltower"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中校！敌人正在攻击防御层！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白他们是怎么突然冒出来的，就算藏在货运线路里，能通过地面上萨卡兹设下的哨卡，也没有理由躲过塔的监控系统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非有人黑进了系统，并且在极短的时间内干掉了所有哨兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是这......这怎么可能呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有什么不可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阴影朝他飞速袭来。\n他嗅到了死亡的气息，不同于在血魔大君面前时感受到的那种黏稠的窒息感，他知道这一回自己会死得很干脆，而且没什么痛苦。\n所以他没有无意义地闪躲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们果然来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡纶......我们有多久没见了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九天前，在你闯入西部大堂的时候，你也准备像现在这样，把将军赐给你的武器指向他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，不像你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会犹豫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
